{"comments":"Card Media — Media zones for cards.\n\n## Design Philosophy\n\nMedia (images, videos, Lottie animations) can be positioned in various\nzones within a card:\n- Top/Bottom: Full-width media above/below content\n- Left/Right: Side-by-side with content\n- Cover: Full background with overlay\n- Background: Behind content (parallax capable)\n\n## Use Cases\n\n- Product cards with hero images\n- Profile cards with avatars\n- Article cards with cover images\n- Portfolio items with video previews\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- Schema.Dimension.Device (sizing)\n","declarations":[{"children":[{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[156,13],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Element/Compound/Card/Media.purs","start":[156,3]},"title":"MediaTop"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[157,16],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Element/Compound/Card/Media.purs","start":[157,3]},"title":"MediaBottom"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[158,14],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Element/Compound/Card/Media.purs","start":[158,3]},"title":"MediaLeft"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[159,15],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Element/Compound/Card/Media.purs","start":[159,3]},"title":"MediaRight"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[160,15],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Element/Compound/Card/Media.purs","start":[160,3]},"title":"MediaCover"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[161,20],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Element/Compound/Card/Media.purs","start":[161,3]},"title":"MediaBackground"},{"comments":null,"info":{"declType":"instance","dependencies":[],"type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Data","Eq"],"Eq"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Element","Compound","Card",